  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting a Victim Centered Approach to Counter Trafficking in Persons in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote the victim centered approach to counter trafficking and victim support efforts in Uzbekistan, by means of enhancing access to psychosocial services and reintegration means for victims, as well as contributing to capacities of government entities, government funded shelters and NGOs, fostering social partnership, improving legal frameworks of victim protection, which lead to strengthened victim identification, protection and referral.</narrative>
  </description>
